      "description": "A scene depicting a man holding car keys while another person holds a glass of alcohol, with text questioning why alcohol is banned in Islamic countries but not in Western countries. The man appears to be offering or presenting the keys, while the other person is holding the alcohol, suggesting a contrast or comparison between the two items.",
