      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_f937274b",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet audience familiar with cultural and religious comparisons",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience that is aware of the cultural and religious differences between Islamic countries and Western countries, particularly regarding alcohol consumption. It targets individuals who engage with internet debates, social media discussions, or political commentary that involve moral relativism, cultural comparisons, or critiques of religious laws. The audience is expected to understand the context of alcohol bans in Islamic countries (based on Sharia law) and the permissive stance in Western countries (based on secularism), and to be able to interpret the visual metaphor of car keys versus alcohol as a commentary on consumerism or moral standards.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
